    <string name="collection_key_gone_title">This collection can\'t be opened</string>
    <string name="collection_key_gone_message">Its encryption key is gone. That usually happens when the screen lock is removed from a device, which destroys the keys tied to it.\n\nThe notes are still on this device, but nothing can decrypt them — not Quill, and not your PIN. You can leave them alone or delete them.</string>
